# Memory Acquisition

## i. Purpose

The purpose of this stage was to capture the volatile memory of the Windows 10 victim machine for further investigation.

## ii. Tool Used

i. WinPmem
ii. Windows 10 victim machine
iii. External storage

## iii. Memory Capture

I captured the memory from the running Windows 10 victim machine.

The memory dump was saved as:

`CASE-001.mem`

The captured memory was preserved for analysis with Volatility 3.

## iv. Evidence Information
i. Case ID: CASE-001
ii. Evidence: Windows 10 memory
iii. File: CASE-001.mem
iv. Analysis tool: Volatility 3

## v. Integrity
I generated and recorded a hash for the memory evidence to verify its integrity during the investigation.

## vi. Result

The memory capture was successfully obtained and preserved for the memory analysis stage.
